      "opportunityName": "Discover Creative Careers: Lost in Translation? Not With Dals!",
      "opportunityDescription": "\u003Cp\u003EA Journey into Interpreting, Translation &amp; Languages \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECould your language skills open the door to a career you’ve never considered? \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJoin \u003Cstrong\u003Edals\u003C/strong\u003E for an interactive virtual Insight Day and discover what it is really like to work in the world of interpreting, translation and language services. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou might think that working with languages simply means becoming a translator – but there is a whole industry behind helping people communicate across languages, cultures and communities. During this exciting session, you’ll discover how language professionals support people and organisations across a wide range of sectors, including healthcare, law, education, business, travel, public services and more. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou will hear directly from people working at \u003Cstrong\u003Edals\u003C/strong\u003E about their careers, what their roles involve and the different routes they have taken into the industry. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou will also get to have a go yourself through interactive challenges, exploring what it takes to interpret meaning, listen carefully, communicate clearly and think on your feet. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat will you discover? \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhat is the difference between interpreting and translation? \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhat does a language professional actually do? \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhere can interpreting and translation take you? \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhat skills are important for a career in the language industry? \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhat different jobs and career pathways are available? \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHow can languages be used across different industries? \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhat is it really like to work in this sector? \u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThere will also be opportunities to ask questions directly to dals professionals and find out more about their own career journeys.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat will you gain?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBy taking part, you’ll develop your understanding of the language services industry while building valuable skills including communication, active listening, teamwork, problem solving and cultural awareness.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMost importantly, you’ll discover that a career involving languages can take you in many different directions.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou don't need to know exactly what career you want yet – this session is about exploring what's possible.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiscover Creative Careers with dals and find out where your language skills could take you.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
