      "opportunityName": "Discover Creative Careers: From Idea to Digital Experience with Layers Studio",
      "opportunityDescription": "\u003Cp\u003EAre you curious about how websites, apps and digital experiences are created? \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJoin Layers Studio for an exciting Insight Day and discover how creativity and technology come together to turn ideas into digital experiences. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELayers Studio is a creative digital studio where designers, developers and strategists work together to create websites, apps and digital products for clients. You don't need to be a designer or know how to code to take part. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis session is all about exploring what's possible and discovering the different creative careers behind the technology we use every day. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDuring the day, you'll:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeet people working in different roles at Layers Studio and hear about their careers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFind out how a digital project goes from an initial idea to a finished product.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExplore \u003Cstrong\u003EUX and UI design\u003C/strong\u003E – how digital products are designed around the people who use them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESee how designers and developers work together.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETake part in a creative challenge and develop your own digital idea.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWork in a team to solve a problem and create a digital concept.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPresent your idea to the Layers Studio team and get feedback from industry professionals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFind out more about the skills, qualifications and routes that can lead to careers in the creative and digital industries.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYour creative challenge\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou'll work as part of a team on a creative brief challenge:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou won't need to code your idea – you'll be encouraged to \u003Cstrong\u003Ethink creatively, solve problems, work as a team and bring your ideas to life.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWho is this for?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis opportunity is for \u003Cstrong\u003Eyoung people aged 14–18\u003C/strong\u003E who are curious about the creative and digital industries.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhether you're already interested in \u003Cstrong\u003Edesign, technology, coding, websites, apps or creative problem-solving\u003C/strong\u003E, or you're simply wondering what careers are available, this is a chance to get behind the scenes and discover what's possible.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThis opportunity is part of Discover Creative Careers, helping young people explore the wide range of careers available across the creative industries.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat skills will you use?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou'll have the opportunity to develop and demonstrate skills including:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECreativity • Problem Solving • Teamwork • Communication • Leadership • Resilience\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECome along, get creative and discover where your ideas could take you.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
