      "opportunityName": "Building the Future: Interactive Tech Skills and Career Discovery ",
      "opportunityDescription": "\u003Ch1\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EThis opportunity is open to young people in the East Midlands only\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExplore the Future of Tech: A 3-Day Virtual Experience \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInterested in technology but not sure where to start?\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJoin our 3-day virtual work experience to explore what a career in tech is really like, learn new digital skills, and connect with people working in the industry today.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat you’ll do: \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDiscover Tech Roles: Get a jargon-free look at different jobs, from coding and product management to marketing and design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGet Hands-On: Try your hand at app wireframing, basic coding, and creative problem-solving.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESolve Real Problems: Work in small groups to design a digital solution for a social issue, with support from industry mentors.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHear Real Stories: Meet professionals who will share how they started their own tech journeys, including those who took non-traditional paths.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat you’ll gain: \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou will finish the three days with a clearer understanding of your strengths, boosted confidence in your creative and team-working skills, and a practical \"next steps\" plan to help you move forward into education, training, or a career.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWho we are: \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis programme is hosted by the Mindera UK Foundation - The Charity foundation of the Software engineering company Mindera. We are dedicated to making the tech industry fair, inclusive, and accessible to everyone, regardless of where you’re starting from. We provide a safe, supportive space for you to discover your potential.\u003C/p\u003E",
