      "opportunityName": "Dive into the world of Water Science: 3-Day Hybrid Work Experience with NI Water",
      "opportunityDescription": "\u003Cp\u003EAre you 16 - 19yrs and curious about where science could take you? Step into the world of water science with Northern Ireland Water and discover how chemistry, microbiology and innovation keep your water clean and the environment protected.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhat’s the Buzz?\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJoin us for an exciting 3-day hybrid programme where you’ll go behind the scenes of one of Northern Ireland’s biggest organisations and uncover the science powering your water supply. From analytical chemistry to wastewater treatment, science is at the heart of it all!\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhat You'll Do:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E✅ Get Hands-On: Take part in interactive breakout sessions, solve real-world water challenges, and explore how science tackles everything from bacteria to climate change.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E✅ Meet the Pros: Hear directly from our laboratory scientists, early-career experts, and industry leaders about their journeys and the exciting opportunities in water science\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E✅ Science Career Masterclass: Get practical advice on how to kickstart a career in science – including CV and interview tips for making your application stand out.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E✅ Explore Science in Action: Take a virtual reality tour of our water and wastewater treatment sites and join us in person for a live lab tour at our Belfast facility.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E✅ Go Beyond the Textbook: Learn how we use cutting-edge technology in analytical chemistry and microbiology to deliver safe, clean water to over 800,000 homes and businesses.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhy You Should Join:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E• Discover scientific careers you may have never considered\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E• Build confidence, skills, and meaningful connections\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E• Be inspired by a team that’s protecting health, the environment, and our future\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENI Water – More Than Just a Job. It’s a Future in Science.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003EApply now – limited spaces! (\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/strong\u003EPlease note: Application deadlines may be brought forward if oversubscribed. Please apply early to secure your place.)\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E🌐 Learn more: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.niwater.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EHome - Northern Ireland Water (niwater.com)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
