      "opportunityName": "Discover Creative Careers: How a Book Comes to Life",
      "opportunityDescription": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEver wondered what happens behind the scenes of a book?\u003C/strong\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFrom the first idea to the finished book on a shelf, there’s a whole team of creative people making it happen. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJoin \u003Cstrong\u003ELegend Times Ltd\u003C/strong\u003E for three days of hands-on work experience and discover what it’s really like to work in the publishing industry. You'll get to step inside a real publishing workplace, meet people working in the industry and find out about the different careers involved in bringing books to life. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat will you discover? \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E📚 Editorial How do publishers decide which ideas make it to publication? What does an editor actually do? \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E🎨 Design How do you create a book cover that catches someone's eye and tells them something about the story inside? \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E🖨️ Production What happens between an idea being approved and the finished book being produced? \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E📣 Marketing &amp; Publicity How do you make people notice a new book – and want to read it? \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E💼 Sales How does a book get from a publisher to retailers and readers? \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGet involved, not just watch. It's about more than books\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou don't have to want to be an author to work in publishing.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou'll discover careers that use skills in \u003Cstrong\u003Ewriting and editing, design, creativity, marketing, communication, business, sales, organisation and problem solving\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThroughout the experience, you'll develop key skills including:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommunication | Teamwork | Creativity | Problem Solving | Leadership | Resilience\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWith just \u003Cstrong\u003Esix places available\u003C/strong\u003E, you'll have plenty of opportunities to get involved, work directly with the Legend Times team and find out what a career in publishing could look like for you.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENo previous publishing experience is needed – just bring your ideas, curiosity and willingness to get involved.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
